{
  "engine": "tax-pph21/withholding",
  "rateSet": "structural-fiction-v1",
  "_readme": [
    "Structural vectors (ADR-0018 §3): rate-independent logic only, computed against the",
    "deliberately fictional tax section of structural-fiction-v1.ts — PTKP 100,000,000, band",
    "boundaries on round millions, 10%-step rates, a 100% non-NPWP surcharge. Nothing here",
    "is or resembles Indonesian regulation.",
    "What these pin: TER on the month's cumulative bruto with the MTD credit, band lower",
    "edges inclusive, the gross-up closed form landing in the band that priced it, the",
    "annual sequence (biaya jabatan under both caps → deductible contributions → PTKP → PKP",
    "floored DOWN → marginal brackets → credits), a negative remainder emerging as a refund,",
    "prior-employer figures feeding the annual path only, the severance bands cumulative",
    "over the year and outside both paths, and half-up rounding of the withholding.",
    "A failing vector is a code defect until a human re-verifies it and records why it",
    "changed; a vector is never edited to make a test pass (testing-strategy §6.1).",
    "Input mirrors Pph21Input minus `parameters` (injected by the runner from the declared",
    "rateSet). Expected omits `trace` — the runner asserts trace presence structurally."
  ],
